# Typed by hand from Jemmali et al., Chem. Met. Alloys 3 (2010) 126 (open access), Table 1 (cell, single
# crystal, Mo Ka, room temperature) and Table 2 (coordinates, Fe occupancy 0.37(1), Ueq). Not from an ICDD card.
# The ICDD card used before (04-019-1690) is GdFe0.52Ge2 with a different cell; its source paper could not be
# identified (the card CIF carries no citation). This is the only GdFe(1-x)Ge2 single-crystal refinement found
# in an accessible publication. Fe occupancy held at the published 0.37 (the driver does not refine it).

